text Route131_Text_HermanDefeat {
    format("Bleah!")
}

text Route131_Text_HermanIntro {
    format("The sea… The sea… The sea… The sea as far as these eyes can see! I'm sick and tired of the sea!")
}

text Route131_Text_HermanPostBattle {
    format("Bored I am by the sea, but swim I must.\pI'm a born swimmer! That's what I am.")
}

text Route131_Text_KaraDefeat {
    format("I'm out of my depth!")
}

text Route131_Text_KaraIntro {
    format("Why do men love bathing suits so much?\pThey all ogle me!")
}

text Route131_Text_KaraPostBattle {
    format("Maybe it's not my bathing suit that makes men look. It must be my beauty!")
}

text Route131_Text_KevinDefeat {
    format("Oops!")
}

text Route131_Text_KevinIntro {
    format("The people of PACIFIDLOG are a peaceful bunch.\pThey never get angry. That goes for me, too.")
}

text Route131_Text_KevinPostBattle {
    format("Tch! …Oh, wait. I'm not angry. Honestly!\pBut, boy, you're strong! Hahaha!")
}

text Route131_Text_RichardDefeat {
    format("POKéMON raised by TRAINERS are seriously tough…")
}

text Route131_Text_RichardIntro {
    format("The sea is teeming with POKéMON. It's not easy swimming, I tell you.")
}

text Route131_Text_RichardPostBattle {
    format("Gasp… Gasp… I'm wiped out…\pThe going's easy. It's the leaving that's the hard part.\pWill I have any energy left to make the return trip?")
}

text Route131_Text_SusieDefeat {
    format("You're tough in spite of the way you look!")
}

text Route131_Text_SusieIntro {
    format("Hi, sweetie, wait! We should battle, you and I!")
}

text Route131_Text_SusiePostBattle {
    format("Did you see a guy over there who whines that he's bored of the sea?\pThat's all talk. He's hopelessly in love with the sea!")
}

text Route131_Text_TaliaDefeat {
    format("Oh? Did I lose?")
}

text Route131_Text_TaliaIntro {
    format("If you can beat me, I'll give you some great information!")
}

text Route131_Text_TaliaPostBattle {
    format("There is an odd place nearby. There's a huge tower there. Why don't you go take a look?")
}
text Route131_Text_IanPostBattle {
    format("IAN: You know how PACIFIDLOG is a floating town?\pSo, wherever there is the sea, that's a part of PACIFIDLOG!")
}

text Route131_Text_ReliPostBattle {
    format("RELI: The people of PACIFIDLOG are together with the sea and POKéMON from the time they are born.")
}
